<h2 class="ab-title ab-split">Business &amp; Human Development</h2>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="ab-rule"/>
<p class="ab-rv">HummingBeing is part of <strong>Business and Human Development Consulting Pte Ltd</strong> — a boutique Leadership Coaching and Human Development consultancy established in Singapore in 2012.</p>
<p class="ab-rv">Our work extends BHD's mission into the body — offering somatic practices that complement leadership coaching and support anyone ready to access more of who they already are.</p>
